---
import AppLayout from "$src/layouts/AppLayout.astro"
---

<AppLayout title="About" subtitle="Personal tool, open source">
	<section class="panel mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm font-bold">
		<p>
			Hi! I'm <a class="link" href="https://goulven-clech.dev/"
				>Goulven Clec'h</a
			>, a software developer based in Toulouse, France.
		</p>
		<p>
			<span class="text-primary font-black uppercase">Body</span> is my own workout
			tracker: strength sessions at the gym, conditioning workouts at home, and my
			sleep, steps and weight, with automated agenda and double progression.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="panel mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm font-bold">
		<p>
			The rationale behind the programme is on the <a
				class="link"
				href="https://goulven-clech.dev/health#physical_activity">health page</a
			> of my personal website. The code is <a
				class="link"
				href="https://github.com/goulvenclech/goulven-clech.dev/tree/main/packages/body"
				>on GitHub</a
			>, free to fork for your own usage.
		</p>
		<p>
			If you have any questions or feedback, feel free to reach out by <a
				class="link"
				href="mailto:goulven.clech@protonmail.com">email</a
			> !
		</p>
	</section>
</AppLayout>
